Tempestarii Rapid Weather	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:TempestariiClassFeature	DESC:A tempestarii is an expert at manipulating weather, and can do so much more quickly than most. When using control weather to change the weather’s severity, the change happens by an additional level per round for every tempestarii level possessed; 2 steps at level 1, 3 steps at level 2, etc.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/tempestarii#toc6	DEFINE:SPHERES_TEMPESTARII_WEATHER_STEPS|0	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_TEMPESTARII_WEATHER_STEPS|1+SPHERES_TEMPESTARII_LEVEL
Tempestarii Ship Smasher	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:TempestariiClassFeature	DESC:Beginning at 2nd level, when damaging objects (including airships and other vehicles) with his weather effects (including cold, heat, and lightning), the damage is not divided in half, as would be normal for energy effects.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/tempestarii#toc7
Tempestarii Grand Weather	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:TempestariiClassFeature	DESC:The reach of your weather effects increases: medium range becomes long range, while long range becomes extreme range (1000 ft. +100 ft. per level). If using the Climate advanced talent, double its reach.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/tempestarii#toc8
Tempestarii Ship Killer	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:TempestariiClassFeature	DESC:Beginning at 4th level, damage dealt to objects (including airships and other vehicles) by the tempestarii’s weather effects are doubled.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/tempestarii#toc9
Tempestarii Deadly Weather	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:TempestariiClassFeature	DESC:At 5th level, whenever you deal damage with a weather effect created by control weather, it deals maximum damage.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/tempestarii#toc10
Tempestarii Instant Weather	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:TempestariiClassFeature	DESC:At 5th level, when the tempestarii uses control weather to change the weather’s severity, the change happens immediately, no matter how many levels the severity is being changed.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/tempestarii#toc11
